     <td><para unique="1046830">(AVX512VL AND</para>
      <para unique="1046834">AVX512F) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+421549"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046836">Converts 4 packed quad-word integers from ymm2 into 4 packed byte integers in xmm1/m32 with truncation under writemask k1.</para>
