     <td><para unique="1046819">Converts 4 packed signed quad-word integers from ymm2 into 4 packed signed byte integers in xmm1/m32 using signed saturation under writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1046787">EVEX.256.F3.0F38.W0 12 /r</para>
      <para unique="1046788">VPMOVUSQB xmm1/m32 {k1}{z}, ymm2</para>
